\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Confidential multi-tenant LLM inference architecture. \textbf  {Layer\nobreakspace  {}1}: Multi-tenant request router with per-tenant authentication and policy enforcement. \textbf  {Layer\nobreakspace  {}2}: AI Governance and Compliance layer with SBOM provenance (Chainguard-style), compliance graph queries (Wiz-style), bias monitoring, and audit logging under SLSA\nobreakspace  {}L3, EU AI Act, GDPR, and HIPAA. \textbf  {Layer\nobreakspace  {}3}: Confidential compute enclave with TEE boundary spanning Intel TDX, AMD SEV-SNP, and NVIDIA CC GPU---model weights never leave the TEE. \textbf  {Layer\nobreakspace  {}4}: Isolated tenant execution with per-tenant LoRA adapters, sovereign full-model deployments, and shared-base with private RAG. \textbf  {Layer\nobreakspace  {}5}: Secure storage with encrypted model vault, HSM-backed key management, and immutable audit trail. Zero-trust principle: no plaintext data exists outside the TEE boundary.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{2}}
